{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"A subject that broadcasts its current value and all subsequent values to multiple consumers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It can also handle completion events, including normal termination and failure with an error.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s CurrentValueSubject.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/Iterator"],"title":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/init()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/init(_:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/value"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/makeAsyncIterator()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/send()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/send(_:)","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/send(completion:)"],"title":"Instance Methods"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/Completion"],"title":"Enumerations"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/AsyncSequence-Implementations","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/AsyncSequence-Implementation